    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: October 2026</p>
    <p>At <strong>LifeWebLab</strong>, accessible from lifeweblab.com, the privacy of our visitors is of paramount importance to us. This Privacy Policy outlines the types of personal information that is collected and recorded by LifeWebLab and how we utilize it.</p>

    <h2>Log Files & Analytics</h2>
    <p>LifeWebLab follows standard web procedures of using log files and privacy-focused web analytics. These files record visits when visitors access websites. Information gathered includes IP addresses, browser types, Internet Service Providers (ISP), date/time stamps, referring/exit pages, and click counts. None of this data is linked to personally identifiable information.</p>

    <h2>Cookies and Web Beacons</h2>
    <p>Like any other website, LifeWebLab uses cookies to store information about visitors' preferences, optimize user experience, and tailor website content according to visitors' browser types and navigational patterns.</p>

    <h2>Third-Party Advertisers (Google AdSense)</h2>
    <p>Third-party ad servers or ad networks use technologies like cookies, JavaScript, or Web Beacons in their respective advertisements and links that appear on LifeWebLab. They automatically receive your IP address when this occurs. LifeWebLab has no access to or control over these cookies used by third-party advertisers.</p>

    <h2>Consent</h2>
    <p>By using our website, you hereby consent to our Privacy Policy and agree to its terms.</p>
